From 1caa96656d5f3ec97fcf93f507bd31f60ef02e4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r5 <r5@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:47:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 17/25] r5: fused MoE tail for single-token decode (IK_R5_FMOE)

Routed down + weighted sum + residual + shared-expert down + gate + final add run as one
node: per-thread output-row slices over all 8 routed experts and the shared expert, node-local
weights under the NUMA mirror. Inputs are quantized/snapshotted before the reordered shared-expert
gate/up nodes run, so compute-buffer reuse cannot break it. Bitwise identical outputs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
